      "kind": "paragraph",
      "inlines": [
       {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "DevOps / Platform Engineer with 8+ years building and scaling CI/CD and Kubernetes platforms on two public clouds and on-premises. Designs CI/CD with security built in (static and dynamic analysis, image signing, SBOM), GitOps with Argo CD, and reusable Terraform and Ansible modules. Strong Java/Spring, Python and event-driven troubleshooting; 11 years at a Big Four firm, 20 years in IT infrastructure.",
        "bold": false,
        "italic": false,
        "underline": false
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
